// The map deadline for Avaricum: a player still inside the city on the day it
// falls lives through the assault (Caesar BG VII.27-28) and gets out with the
// few who escaped. Shown plainly and briefly.
@speaker Avaricum
=== start
[quest nertomara active] ~ quest nertomara failed failed
